<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <title>Sports Club From Group #2</title>

    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f1f2f3;
        }

        header {
            background-color: #0077cc;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: white;
            margin: 20px;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            box-shadow: 0px 2px 5px rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
        }

        h2 {
            color: #0077cc;
        }

        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        table, th, td {
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
        }

        th {
            background-color: #0077cc;
            color: white;
        }

        th, td {
            padding: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        tr:nth-child(even) {
            background-color: #f9f9f9;
        }

        footer {
            background-color: #0077cc;
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 15px;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

<header>
    <h1>🏆 Sports Club</h1>
    <p>Building Fitness, Teamwork, and Sportsmanship</p>
</header>

<section>
    <h2>Introduction</h2>
    <p>
        The Sports Club is a student organization that promotes physical fitness,
        teamwork, and sportsmanship through various sports and recreational activities.
        It gives students opportunities to stay active, develop their skills, and
        build friendships in a fun and healthy environment.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Sports Club Activities</h2>

    <table>
        <tr>
            <th>Sport</th>
            <th>Activity</th>
            <th>Available Days</th>
            <th>Available Time</th>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Basketball</td>
            <td>Skills Training & Friendly Games</td>
            <td>Monday, Wednesday</td>
            <td>3:00 PM - 5:00 PM</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Volleyball</td>
            <td>Team Practice & Matches</td>
            <td>Tuesday, Thursday</td>
            <td>3:00 PM - 5:00 PM</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Badminton</td>
            <td>Singles and Doubles Practice</td>
            <td>Friday</td>
            <td>3:00 PM - 5:00 PM</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Soccer</td>
            <td>Drills and Team Play</td>
            <td>Saturday</td>
            <td>8:00 AM - 11:00 AM</td>
        </tr>

        <tr>
            <td>Table Tennis</td>
            <td>Practice Sessions</td>
            <td>Wednesday, Friday</td>
            <td>4:00 PM - 6:00 PM</td>
        </tr>
    </table>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Purpose of the Sports Club</h2>
    <p>
        The Sports Club aims to encourage students to maintain a healthy lifestyle,
        develop athletic skills, build self-confidence, and learn the values of
        teamwork, discipline, and leadership through participation in sports.
    </p>
</section>

<section>
    <h2>Conclusion</h2>
    <p>
        The Sports Club plays an important role in student development by promoting
        physical and mental well-being. Through sports activities, students gain
        valuable life skills, make new friends, and enjoy a positive and active
        school experience.
    </p>
</section>

<footer>
    <p>© 2026 Sports Club | Group #2</p>
</footer>

</body>
</html>
